      "additional_text": "<b>{Fireball}\nTrigger payload, not a separate main-skill recommendation. Manually socket alongside Flame Wall in Cast on Elemental Ailment before the crit swap, then in Cast on Critical afterwards.\nBoth triggers require a level 14 Uncut Spirit Gem and have 100 Spirit base reservation before modifiers. Both setups use Boundless Energy I/II, Ignite II, and Energy Retention.\nMeta-gem support in the planner is experimental."
